{"4238180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lone Tower", "steam_appid": 4238180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/59899be4ca9a487747ec27e8f05ac6bd.poster.avif?t=1787461189\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/59899be4ca9a487747ec27e8f05ac6bd.webm?t=1787461189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/59899be4ca9a487747ec27e8f05ac6bd.mp4?t=1787461189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/6f7f78bd37fee8cff1dce3de61e0f100.avif?t=1787461189\" width=949 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lone Tower</strong> is a roguelite survivor where every run lets you turn a single Tower into a completely broken monstrosity. Level up and choose perks, building synergies until your arrows, upgrades, and stats are unstoppable! This isn't a traditional Tower Defense game, each decision will make or break your run and learning how to handle different types of enemies is key to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/7ec03c5e6a5b872366c15e3baec7b280.avif?t=1787461189\" width=956 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/9078d6d833bc6f5331c145d3bbe0165a.poster.avif?t=1787461189\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/9078d6d833bc6f5331c145d3bbe0165a.webm?t=1787461189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/9078d6d833bc6f5331c145d3bbe0165a.mp4?t=1787461189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push deeper and upgrade your Tower to face hundreds of Dark Ones minions, unlock new crafting items, powerful arrows, and a ton of other items that improve future runs. Between attempts, plant seeds, farm crops,  mine resources, that give your Tower more power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/616389f2028e4a9eaceb15fa18cd719c.avif?t=1787461189\" width=958 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and level up Cards to unlock powerful new abilities for your tower. Gather resources and materials around the world to Craft with and build up your arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the crumbling kingdom of Estaria, overrun by the Dark One’s creatures. Hold the line, survive the chaos, and when everything inevitably falls apart go ahead and start another run and try to make it a little further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Tower Defense</strong> – Every run reshapes your Lone Tower with new perks, arrows, items and synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Perk &amp; Upgrade System</strong> – Modify arrow types, tower abilities, and defensive mechanics in surprising ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card System</strong> – Collect, level up, and play powerful Cards from your deck for stronger runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Unlocks</strong> – Discover new arrow types, items, and systems that expand future builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming System</strong> – Grow resources between runs with a simple but useful farming mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability</strong> – No two runs play the same thanks to random story events and a variety of level up choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Endless Waves</strong> – Push your limits and see how long your Tower can survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Dark Fantasy World</strong> – Defend Estaria as it slowly collapses under the influence of the Dark One</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Kingdom of Estaria today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/59899be4ca9a487747ec27e8f05ac6bd.poster.avif?t=1787461189\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/59899be4ca9a487747ec27e8f05ac6bd.webm?t=1787461189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/59899be4ca9a487747ec27e8f05ac6bd.mp4?t=1787461189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/6f7f78bd37fee8cff1dce3de61e0f100.avif?t=1787461189\" width=949 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lone Tower</strong> is a roguelite survivor where every run lets you turn a single Tower into a completely broken monstrosity. Level up and choose perks, building synergies until your arrows, upgrades, and stats are unstoppable! This isn't a traditional Tower Defense game, each decision will make or break your run and learning how to handle different types of enemies is key to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/7ec03c5e6a5b872366c15e3baec7b280.avif?t=1787461189\" width=956 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/9078d6d833bc6f5331c145d3bbe0165a.poster.avif?t=1787461189\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/9078d6d833bc6f5331c145d3bbe0165a.webm?t=1787461189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/9078d6d833bc6f5331c145d3bbe0165a.mp4?t=1787461189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push deeper and upgrade your Tower to face hundreds of Dark Ones minions, unlock new crafting items, powerful arrows, and a ton of other items that improve future runs. Between attempts, plant seeds, farm crops,  mine resources, that give your Tower more power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238180/extras/616389f2028e4a9eaceb15fa18cd719c.avif?t=1787461189\" width=958 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and level up Cards to unlock powerful new abilities for your tower. Gather resources and materials around the world to Craft with and build up your arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the crumbling kingdom of Estaria, overrun by the Dark One’s creatures. Hold the line, survive the chaos, and when everything inevitably falls apart go ahead and start another run and try to make it a little further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Tower Defense</strong> – Every run reshapes your Lone Tower with new perks, arrows, items and synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Perk &amp; Upgrade System</strong> – Modify arrow types, tower abilities, and defensive mechanics in surprising ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card System</strong> – Collect, level up, and play powerful Cards from your deck for stronger runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Unlocks</strong> – Discover new arrow types, items, and systems that expand future builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming System</strong> – Grow resources between runs with a simple but useful farming mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability</strong> – No two runs play the same thanks to random story events and a variety of level up choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Endless Waves</strong> – Push your limits and see how long your Tower can survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Dark Fantasy World</strong> – Defend Estaria as it slowly collapses under the influence of the Dark One</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Kingdom of Estaria today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Defend one tower. Face endless waves. Build synergies, unlock permanent upgrades, and survive the chaos.